WEBVTT

NOTE
Irvine Kinneas's introduction at Galbadia Garden.
Irvine is a sharpshooter who joins the party here before the Deling City parade mission.
Duration: approximately 20 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Copper curved railings blur against a bright blue sky.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A butterfly lands on Irvine's outstretched finger. Copper railings frame the blue sky above.


00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Irvine in his cowboy hat lies in the grass by the Garden exterior, relaxed.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Irvine crouches, then firmly stands up

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Third-person rear view of a man with a long ponytail and a black cowboy hat

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
In a brown trench coat holds a rifle, glancing sidelong

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Close-up of a sharp-looking man holding a rifle

